1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:07,205
M: Susan, I need you to make a dozen copies of these reports for tomorrow's meeting with the board members before you take off today.

2
00:00:07,660 --> 00:00:11,140
W: I'm sorry, Mr. Brown, but we are completely out of paper right now.

3
00:00:11,305 --> 00:00:15,460
I called our supplier and made the order last night, but it has not arrived yet.

4
00:00:16,010 --> 00:00:18,120
M: Okay, I will call and find out what's happening.

5
00:00:18,640 --> 00:00:23,340
In the meanwhile, send Peter down to the stationery store to buy some paper right away.

6
00:00:23,580 --> 00:00:28,455
There are a lot of pages to copy, so you'd better get started if you don't want to stay late tonight.

7
00:00:28,515 --> 00:00:28,880
W: All right.

8
00:00:29,335 --> 00:00:31,000
I will take care of the matter right away.
